  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fcb77d2b-8d0a-4d58-93e7-40ac8f983e2f-image.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 293px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>For one second,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>263</mn><mrow><mn>298</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>263</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>263</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>Hence, average heat per second transferred&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>263</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
